partiduo-agent is the executor of the Partiduo fleet administration
(aloli-crystal/partiduo-admin), installed on each hosting server. It pulls
its tasks over HTTPS with the server token and carries them out on the
Partiduo instances of the same server (packages partiduo-app and
partiduo-app-devel): creation, suspension, archiving, backups (optionally
encrypted), restorations, supervision.

Privileged steps go through two wrapper scripts owned by root, the only
commands allowed by sudo (sudoers.d/partiduo-agent), which validate each
argument and read their configuration from
/usr/local/etc/partiduo-agent/helpers.conf.
